This repo is structured in the following way:

1. Documents:
All documents sent/shown to supervisor, including:
1.1 Latest Expose version.
1.2 Questions before and answers after first online meeting.
1.3 Update file with the chosen three models, how they work and what they explain.

2. Guidelines:
Guidelines sent by the supervisor on how to better write academic texts.

3. Papers:
All relevant papers either sent by supervisor or compiler by thesis author until now.

4. Scripts:
Script for report generation, calculation, data management and more.
Currently only includes:
4.1 Script for compiling a .tex document to .pdf for the model brief document.
4.2 Script skeleton for the game theory model